NAME
  vtkSHYXSubsetCoarsen
DESCRIPTION
  "SHYX: coarsen a triangle vtkPolyData without inserting vertices or moving survivors (CGAL edge_collapse onto an original endpoint)."
GROUPS
  Meshing
DEPENDS
  vtkCGALAlgorithm
  VTK::FiltersCore
PRIVATE_DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
